### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### Create a customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan Perez",
  "email": "juan@email.com"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### Get customer by ID (replace {id} with the ID returned above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/1

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### List all customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### Duplicate email (returns 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Otro Cliente",
  "email": "juan@email.com"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### Empty name (returns 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "test@email.com"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### Empty email (returns 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "email": ""
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### Invalid email (returns 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "email": "invalid-email"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### Customer not found (returns 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/999
